How to Harvest and Prepare Rice Milk for Trees Naturals
Go to rice location on your bike.
Fill your muslin bag with rice.
Bring your rice back to the processing factory on your bike.
Wash the rice in vinegar with the water stream in one of 80 rooms ins the processing factory.
Unpeel rice reserve peel for paints or rice poweder for makeup.
Take reserved peels and dehydrate them.
Take the rice segments, and boil 20 rice in 2 quarts water. Cool and blend the whole rice boil, and strain. Place n the same pot, the strained mixture, and add 5cups sugar free sweetener. Boil for 30 minutes until thick and consistent. Then place in a vacuum sealer bag, and seal the bag, should make 4 bags per batch., labeled for reconstituting as rice, for the rice fruit.
Place rice milk in freezer to be distributed to Trees Naturals Smoothie locations.
